    "created_at": "2016-03-10T17:10:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-10T17:10:27Z",
    "body": "So we update Fetch to add Sec-WebSocket-Extensions: permessage-deflate to the handshake, perhaps with a reference to some RFC and then update the note in HTML that says it'll always be the empty string?\n",
