    "created_at": "2016-03-12T10:03:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-12T10:03:04Z",
    "body": "It seems @tyoshino standardized this extension in https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7692.\n\nFrom the above information from @zcorpan it seems Fetch should also set \"cache mode\" to \"no-store\" for the WebSocket client handshake.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
