    "created_at": "2016-03-14T12:29:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-14T12:29:53Z",
    "body": "FYI, regarding `Accept-Language`, Chromium was not sending it in a WebSocket handshake, but in response to https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=174956, added it to allow apps to know the preferred language info only from the WebSocket connection.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
