    "created_at": "2016-03-14T12:30:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-14T12:30:12Z",
    "body": "The language I wrote for Fetch leaves the exact value up to implementations, but does restrict things to the \"permessage-deflate\" extension. So if there was going to be a new extension, Fetch would have to be updated. And HTML maybe too, since HTML seems to assume there is only a single extension.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
